            "value": "Você concluiu %@ de %@ etapas de %@."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt %@ van %@ stappen voor %@ afgerond."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%3$@ 요리의 총 %2$@단계 중 %1$@단계를 완료했습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Recipe Pals account identifies future private cloud data. It is separate from the Apple ID that owns an App Store subscription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私人菜谱账号用于标识今后的私有云端数据，与拥有 App Store 订阅的 Apple ID 相互独立。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私人菜譜帳號用來識別未來的私有雲端資料，與擁有 App Store 訂閱的 Apple ID 彼此獨立。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recipe Palsアカウントは今後のプライベートなクラウドデータを識別します。App Storeのサブスクリプションを所有するApple IDとは別です。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Recipe-Pals-Konto kennzeichnet künftige private Cloud-Daten. Es ist getrennt von der Apple-ID, der das App-Store-Abo gehört."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre compte Recipe Pals identifie les futures données cloud privées. Il est distinct de l’identifiant Apple auquel appartient un abonnement App Store."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu cuenta de Recipe Pals identifica futuros datos privados en la nube. Es independiente del Apple ID al que pertenece una suscripción del App Store."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo account Recipe Pals identifica i futuri dati cloud privati. È separato dall’ID Apple a cui appartiene l’abbonamento App Store."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sua conta Recipe Pals identifica futuros dados privados na nuvem. Ela é separada do ID Apple ao qual pertence uma assinatura da App Store."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je Recipe Pals-account identificeert toekomstige privégegevens in de cloud. Het staat los van de Apple ID waaraan een App Store-abonnement is gekoppeld."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recipe Pals 계정은 향후 비공개 클라우드 데이터를 식별합니다. App Store 구독을 소유한 Apple ID와는 별개입니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
